  {
   "id": "c-speed",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "The book prints $2\\sqrt{256{(\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}-16(\\frac{1}{3})+4901}\\approx 140.34$ ft/s. With $s'(t)=2\\sqrt{256t^{2}-32t+4901}$ from above, $s'(\\frac{1}{3})=2\\sqrt{256{(\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}-32(\\frac{1}{3})+4901}\\approx 140.27$ ft/s, still about 95 mph."
  },
  {
   "id": "c-cp7-interval",
   "kind": "correction",
